==Changelog January 22nd==
{{Collapsed section|18|CLICK HERE TO SHOW}}
'''Game Jam updates'''

* Customizable Mini Menu improvements let you hover to view all teleport options for smoother escapes.
* The new Inventory to Bank Locking feature prevents accidental banking of essential items, making trips easier and more efficient.

'''Leagues V Ends and Bug Fixes'''

* Leagues V has concluded! Check out the League Firsts board in Lumbridge Castle Courtyard.
* Restored the stats of the Virtus Mask. Additionally, it will no longer appear as “The Batman" floating head in the chat box.
* Added functionality to remove the Raging Echoes scrolls from PoH furniture.
* Added Echo Venator Bow Ornament Kit and Echo Spirit Tree Scroll to be marketable via the GE.
* Added a rotation option for PoH Spirit Trees, accessed by using a spade on the tree.
* Raging Echoes Relic Hunter sets are now storable on the PoH Armour Stand.
* The Virtus Ornament kit outfit is now storable in the magic wardrobe.
* Fixed a bug where the Goblin Decorations would not change the appearance of specific PoH items.
* The Venator Bow has a new projectile that more closely matches the one in the concept art.
* Players are now redirected to the Spirit Tree in their PoH when using the Fairy Ring teleports, instead of being teleported to the Fairy Ring, due to the Raging Echo override.
* Ahrim's Ornament Kit can now be used on an Ahrim's Staff, and purchasing Ahrim's Kits from the Reward Shop will now provide four kits rather than three to match this. For those who bought a set of kits from the reward shop before this update, an extra kit will be added to your Bank at some time post-update, as this is a manual process.
'''Other changes'''

* Updated side panel tabs to match players' side panel transparency settings.
* Further changes to Chambers of Xeric points have been made to prevent megascale boosting: Personal points are no longer capped at 131,071 during the raid, while regular loot reward rolls are still capped at 131,071 points.
* Guildmaster Jane now speaks fewer lines of dialogue when she rewards you for completing a contract and offers you another one.
* Fixed the non-functional options for equipping Trailblazer Tools from the Bank menu.
* Updated the menu ordering for certain items, including Drakan's Medallion and Pharaoh's Sceptre, to prioritize key actions over the 'Use' option.

'''Client and Mobile Updates'''

